    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The DeepSeekMath model is trained in three stages: math pre-training, mathematical instruction tuning, and reinforcement learning using GRPO. <strong>Math pre-training</strong> involves training the model on the DeepSeekMath Corpus, while <strong>mathematical instruction tuning</strong> fine-tunes the model on a dataset of mathematical problems with solutions. GRPO is an efficient reinforcement learning algorithm that <strong>obviates the need for a value function</strong> and instead uses the average reward of multiple sampled outputs as the baseline.",
