    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "DeepSeekMath achieves state-of-the-art results on various mathematical benchmarks, including GSM8K, MATH, and CMATH. The model <strong>surpasses all open-source models</strong> and approaches the performance level of GPT-4 on academic benchmarks. The authors also demonstrate the effectiveness of GRPO in improving the model's mathematical reasoning capabilities.",
