    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "DeepSeekMath has significant implications for the development of language models that can reason and solve mathematical problems. The <strong>scalability of math pre-training</strong> and the <strong>efficiency of GRPO</strong> make it possible to train large-scale language models that can approach human-level mathematical reasoning capabilities. The authors also highlight the potential applications of DeepSeekMath in areas such as education and research.",
